{"id":"8ba6597a854c206f","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-smn.md","title":"参数定理 s-m-n","display":"thm-smn — 参数定理 s-m-n","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-smn","aliases":["20-thm-smn"],"display":"thm-smn — 参数定理 s-m-n","chapter":"1","section":"1.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 1.5.5；Remark 1.5.6 的多参数推广","source_pdf_pages":[48],"source_printed_pages":[12],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-lem-padding]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-smn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-smn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smn — 参数定理 s-m-n"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 1.5.5；Remark 1.5.6 的多参数推广"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>48</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>12</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\ge1\">\\(m,n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(n)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\)</span> 使用固定元数输入编码。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smn}\\vdash\n\\exists s_n^m\\in\\mathcal C_{m+1}^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e,j\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\omega^m\\\n[s_n^m(e,\\vec a)=s_n^m(j,\\vec b)\\Rightarrow(e=j\\land\\vec a=\\vec b)],\\\\\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\omega^m\\ \\forall\\vec y\\in\\omega^n\\\n\\bigl[\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec a)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec a,\\vec y)\\bigr]\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smn}\\vdash\n\\exists s_n^m\\in\\mathcal C_{m+1}^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e,j\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\omega^m\\\n[s_n^m(e,\\vec a)=s_n^m(j,\\vec b)\\Rightarrow(e=j\\land\\vec a=\\vec b)],\\\\\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\omega^m\\ \\forall\\vec y\\in\\omega^n\\\n\\bigl[\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec a)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec a,\\vec y)\\bigr]\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先取全可计算编译器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(e,\\vec a)\">\\(q(e,\\vec a)\\)</span>，将参数写入有限程序并模拟第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个程序。用整体单射的 padding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_n^m(e,\\vec a)=p(q(e,\\vec a),\\operatorname{code}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a))\">\\(s_n^m(e,\\vec a)=p(q(e,\\vec a),\\operatorname{code}_{m+1}(e,\\vec a))\\)</span>；固定元数元组码可反复配对构成，且为单射。若两个输出指标相等，padding 的单射性使两个元组码相等，再解码便得全部输入相等；padding 保持被计算的函数，所以参数等式亦保持。Theorem 1.5.5 的单射条件现在位于 Assertion，可供带参数递归及统一固定点编译直接引用。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 1.5.5；Remark 1.5.6 的多参数推广；印刷页 12；PDF 第 48 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3"